# Build context is the repo root; keep it small and secret-free.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.angular
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/shared/src/generated
apps/web
# Dockerfiles reach BuildKit anyway; excluding them keeps a Dockerfile edit from invalidating COPY layers.
**/Dockerfile

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.claude
infra
docker-compose.yml
**/*.md
